  "description": "Ingestion-gate vectors for the proposed §8.3 field list (upstream #101). Each case is a §3.6 Authorization payload and the expected result of the Luhn gate run field by field: every leaf string or integer is scanned with the §8.3 PAN regex (/\\b(\\d[ -]?){13,19}\\b/) and passesLuhn, except the exact paths charge_id, ds_transaction_id, idempotency_key, mit_mandate_ref, network_transaction_id, payment_intent_id, stablecoin.amount_atomic. Not valid under v1.0.3-rc.2: rc.2 rejects both accept cases that use a listed field.",
